    "Nothing to measure yet. Numbers appear once you've used the app for a few days." : {},
    "Nothing to transcribe. Check the microphone and try again." : {},
    "NVIDIA Parakeet" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "NVIDIA Parakeet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "NVIDIA Parakeet Ultra • Turbo's accuracy, about 20× faster • 25 European languages • ~700MB • Offline" : {},
    "Off" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aus"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off by default — the chat can only read. With it on, the chat can create files, append to them, and replace exact pieces of text. It cannot delete or rename anything, it will not write into `.git` or dependency folders, and the previous content of every changed file is kept for 30 days in the app's WorkspaceBackups folder." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Standardmäßig aus – der Chat kann nur lesen. Eingeschaltet kann er Dateien anlegen, Text anhängen und genau bestimmte Textstellen ersetzen. Er kann nichts löschen oder umbenennen, schreibt nicht in `.git` oder Abhängigkeitsordner, und der vorherige Inhalt jeder geänderten Datei bleibt 30 Tage im Ordner WorkspaceBackups der App erhalten."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Offline" : {
      "comment" : "Model picker badge: runs on-device"
    },
    "Offline Dictation" : {},
    "Offline dictation: Parakeet Ultra by Moondream, a retraining of NVIDIA Parakeet TDT 0.6B v3, and NVIDIA Parakeet CTC 110M for Glossary terms — all licensed CC BY 4.0 — downloaded as FluidInference's Core ML conversions and run through FluidAudio (Apache 2.0). Whisper models by OpenAI (MIT), run through WhisperKit (MIT) by Argmax." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Offline-Diktat: Parakeet Ultra von Moondream, ein Nachtraining von NVIDIA Parakeet TDT 0.6B v3, und NVIDIA Parakeet CTC 110M für Glossarbegriffe, alle unter CC BY 4.0, geladen als Core-ML-Konvertierungen von FluidInference und ausgeführt mit FluidAudio (Apache 2.0). Whisper-Modelle von OpenAI (MIT), ausgeführt mit WhisperKit (MIT) von Argmax."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Offline MLX models run on your Mac with no server. They download from Hugging Face and stay cached locally." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Offline-MLX-Modelle laufen ohne Server auf Ihrem Mac. Sie werden von Hugging Face geladen und lokal gespeichert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Offline Mode" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Offline-Modus"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Offline Mode and macOS permissions" : {},
    "Offline Mode is on, so Chat only uses models on this Mac. Turn it off in Settings to use **%@**." : {},
    "Offline Mode is on, so cloud Read Aloud voices cannot be used. Pick the on-device macOS voice in Settings → Read Aloud, or turn Offline Mode off in Settings → Privacy & Permissions." : {},
    "Offline Mode is on, so nothing may leave this Mac — the request to %@ was blocked. Use an on-device model, or turn Offline Mode off in Settings → Privacy & Permissions." : {},
    "Offline Mode keeps no usage logs, so there is nothing to measure." : {},
    "Offline Model" : {},
    "Offline Model Error" : {},
    "Offline model not initialized" : {},
    "Offline models allow you to transcribe audio without an internet connection. Models are automatically downloaded from HuggingFace and cached locally." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mit Offline-Modellen transkribieren Sie ohne Internetverbindung. Die Modelle werden automatisch von Hugging Face geladen und lokal gespeichert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Offline models ignore the system prompt below — they accept no instructions. Only the Glossary reaches them: as conditioning text for Whisper, as terms Parakeet listens for." : {},
    "Offline models need a Mac with Apple silicon. On this Mac, use a cloud model or a Local Server (Ollama / LM Studio)." : {},
    "Offline transcription failed: %@" : {},
    "OK" : {
      "localizations" : {
