    "On this Mac" : {},
    "On-device" : {},
    "On-device LLM" : {},
    "On-device macOS voices need no API key." : {},
    "On-device macOS voices • No internet, no API key • Automatic choice in Offline Mode" : {},
    "One account for models from every provider. Sign in once — there is no API key to copy." : {},
    "One account or your own server · pick the model below" : {},
    "One-time download, %@" : {},
    "One-time download, then it runs offline. Your message is sent as soon as it's ready." : {},
    "Only %lld of %lld files attached (limit: %lld)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Only %1$lld of %2$lld files attached (limit: %3$lld)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only apps set up with your access key get in, and nothing is reachable from other devices. What you read in an AI app is sent to that app's provider." : {},
    "Only delete interaction history and context; settings are preserved" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nur Nutzungsverlauf und Kontext löschen, die Einstellungen bleiben"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only for Gemini models, and only for what you have connected in Settings → Accounts. Nothing is changed, created or sent. A lookup adds a few seconds to that one request." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nur für Gemini-Modelle und nur für das, was Sie unter Einstellungen → Konten verbunden haben. Es wird nichts geändert, angelegt oder gesendet. Eine Abfrage verlängert diese eine Anfrage um ein paar Sekunden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only models with audio input are listed — anything else fails at request time. Full catalogue:" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nur Modelle mit Audioeingabe stehen hier, alle anderen scheitern bei der Anfrage. Vollständiger Katalog:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
