    "Smart Improvement analyses your usage log with a cloud model, so it is off while Offline Mode is on." : {},
    "Smart Improvement is on cooldown. Try again in %llds." : {},
    "Smart Improvement is optional: when you turn it on in Settings → Smart Improvement, your usage logs are sent to your chosen provider to refine prompts — never to us or anyone else." : {},
    "Smart Improvement Model" : {},
    "Smart Improvement started. You can switch tabs; we'll notify you when it's done." : {},
    "Smart Rewriting" : {},
    "So you can ask \"why did it get that wrong?\" and the AI app looks at what you dictated in the last 7 days." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
