    "The provider accepted this key" : {},
    "The provider rejected this key — check for typos or an expired key" : {},
    "The recording is too short to transcribe." : {},
    "The reply hit the length limit and may be cut off – check the end." : {},
    "The reply was cut off (%@)." : {},
    "The reply was cut off." : {},
    "The report is still here. Try again, or copy the text into a new issue on GitHub." : {},
    "The secure connection to the mail server failed." : {},
    "The server closed the connection." : {},
    "The server rejected the email address or password." : {},
    "The specific voice %@ uses. Each provider has its own set." : {},
    "The transcription failed." : {},
    "The update check still reaches github.com — it sends only the app's version, never content. Switch it off in Settings → About → Updates." : {},
    "The Vertex AI OpenAI-compatible URL shape. Replace <project> with your Google Cloud project id." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das OpenAI-kompatible URL-Format von Vertex AI. Ersetzen Sie <project> durch die ID Ihres Google-Cloud-Projekts."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There is no internet connection, so this meeting can't be transcribed right now.\n\nRecording continues and the audio is kept on this Mac. It is transcribed when the meeting ends, or choose Retry Meeting Transcription in the menu bar menu once you're back online." : {},
    "These features still run on this Mac:\n\n%@\n\nThe cloud models are more accurate and faster. Recordings and text for these features are then sent to %@. You can change each one later in Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "These features still run on this Mac:\n\n%1$@\n\nThe cloud models are more accurate and faster. Recordings and text for these features are then sent to %2$@. You can change each one later in Settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thinking" : {},
    "Thinking effort:" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Denkaufwand:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This change is no longer on record." : {},
    "This chat can use **all %lld shared folders** again." : {},
    "This chat can use **all %lld shared folders**." : {},
    "This chat is limited to **%@**." : {},
    "This chat is pinned to a folder that is no longer shared, so it currently has **no file access**." : {},
    "This chat now uses %@ only — its files and its context files. `/workspace all` restores the rest." : {},
    "This Dictate Prompt model can't read the on-screen selection. Pick a Gemini Dictate Prompt model instead." : {},
    "This endpoint" : {},
    "This is everything the report contains. Nothing is sent automatically — pressing a send button opens your own mail or WhatsApp with this text prefilled." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das ist alles, was der Bericht enthält. Nichts wird automatisch gesendet: Eine Senden-Taste öffnet Ihr eigenes Mailprogramm oder WhatsApp mit diesem Text."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is the complete content, as sent. One summary per day you use the app, plus a one-time note when you pass a setup step or use a feature for the first time. The server's code is public: github.com/mgsgde/whisper-shortcut/tree/main/server/telemetry" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das ist der vollständige Inhalt, so wie er gesendet wird. Eine Zusammenfassung pro Tag, an dem Sie die App nutzen, dazu einmalig ein Hinweis, wenn Sie einen Einrichtungsschritt abschließen oder eine Funktion zum ersten Mal nutzen. Der Code des Servers ist öffentlich: github.com/mgsgde/whisper-shortcut/tree/main/server/telemetry"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This key is not supported" : {},
    "This recording is %@ long. Process anyway? (API usage may incur costs.)" : {},
    "This server's API key" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "API-Schlüssel dieses Servers"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This will delete all settings, system prompts, model selection, chat sessions, meeting transcripts, and interaction data. API keys are preserved.\n\nThe app will close automatically after the reset. You can start it again from the menu bar or Applications. Continue?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Damit werden alle Einstellungen, System-Prompts, die Modellwahl, Chats, Meeting-Transkripte und Nutzungsdaten gelöscht. API-Schlüssel bleiben erhalten.\n\nDie App wird nach dem Zurücksetzen automatisch beendet. Sie können sie danach über die Menüleiste oder den Ordner Programme wieder starten. Fortfahren?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Three quick steps: choose offline or cloud dictation, allow the microphone, and try it once. About a minute." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Drei kurze Schritte: Offline- oder Cloud-Diktat wählen, das Mikrofon erlauben und einmal ausprobieren. Etwa eine Minute."
