    "Your ChatGPT plan can't run part of this request (%@). Remove it and try again." : {},
    "Your ChatGPT plan or workspace doesn't allow use in WhisperShortcut. Pick another chat model, or add an API key in Settings → Accounts." : {},
    "Your ChatGPT Plus or Pro plan · no API key" : {},
    "Your ChatGPT sign-in has expired. Sign in again in Settings → Accounts." : {},
    "Your Glossary is full — Whisper only reads the first ~224 tokens of it, so \"%@\" would never be used. Remove terms you no longer need in Settings → Dictate." : {},
    "your OpenAI API key from Settings → Accounts" : {},
    "Your own Ollama / LM Studio · any model you have pulled" : {},
    "Your own one-click instructions. Each Markdown file in the commands folder becomes a slash command in the chat. Commands for meetings also get a button above the meeting chat's message field." : {},
    "Your own OpenAI-compatible server" : {},
    "Your own OpenAI-compatible server (OpenInference, Azure OpenAI, Vertex AI, LiteLLM, self-hosted) • Configure URL, model and key in Settings → Chat • No web search" : {},
    "Your own OpenAI-compatible server: OpenInference, Azure OpenAI, Vertex AI, LiteLLM or self-hosted. The key entered here is sent only to this server." : {},
